WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.930
It's okay! This place is perfect!

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:23.300
I can't stand the real Gundam!

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.760
Look! This is the Gundam Zebra!

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.720
And this is the Gundam Max Star!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.300
Assault power 26.79 points.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.820
Total power A's top class.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:35.440
Right?

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:36.760
Then...

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.520
Ah...

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:40.740
No matter how many barriers there are, it's dangerous!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:49.990
Get on the Gundam!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:56.440
A feeling of longing for something strong.

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:58.000
A feeling of longing for something cool.

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.520
Don't you all remember?

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.090
Everyone has a longing to ride a Gundam as a boy.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:12.350
That's right, this boy named Chan also had a longing to ride a Gundam.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:20.500
But this time, he has to face the Neo-Indian Cobra Gundam, the Domon.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.200
It's going to be hard for him.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:26.600
Well then, Gundam fight!

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.620
Ready, go!

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:32.840
Do your best, Domo!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.210
A great victory for Domo!

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:47.540
Ahaha, here we are.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.820
The Gundam Maxster's victory.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.900
As expected of the glorious Neo-America's bottom strength.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.180
Now then...

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.360
Tomorrow is the second round of the God Gundam.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.410
As promised, I want a tough opponent for Domon.

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:13.140
Well then, how about this opponent?

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:19.360
This is interesting.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.770
Well then, it's fine.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:29.430
The next opponent of the God Gundam is the Neo-Indian Cobra Gundam.

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:43.100
Hey, are you still going to buy it?

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.660
But you eat a lot, don't you?

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:46.860
Uncle!

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.120
Here you are.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:51.560
500 Neo Hong Kong dollars in total.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.060
But...

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:53.380
What?

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.610
Do I have to pay?

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.360
I'm a guest at the inn.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.600
We're friends, aren't we?

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:01.100
I don't care if you don't like it.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:01.600
Friends?

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:06.260
I'll treat you next time, so don't say anything hard.

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:20.680
No, I felt like someone was looking at me.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.880
It can't be helped.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:28.870
Gundam fans are famous people, so it can't be helped.

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:31.290
I wonder if that's the case.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.720
That's right! That's the case!

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.660
Domon, you're a celebrity here, aren't you?

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.730
Well, I don't feel bad about it.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:43.630
Hey, did you see that?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.370
It's true. As Hoino said, he's a Gundam fighter.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.790
It's true that he became a friend.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:53.250
That's Domon Kassha!

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.840
You know, the guy who declared his victory at the red flag!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.980
That's nice. He's always a Gundam fighter.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:01.160
I wonder if they're showing it to us.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.620
Besides, maybe they're putting it on the Gundam.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.830
On the Gundam?

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.600
This guy...

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.030
Rei, go!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.100
Don't move while hiding!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:36.060
You're the one who's been messing around with me!

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:38.230
Show yourself!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:06.200
Domon Kashu, this is where you die.

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.750
Do you think you can defeat me with such a monster cobra?

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:14.930
Do you want to try?

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:20.250
Shut up!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:44.440
How can you not move?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:49.530
Who are you?

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:53.180
You don't need to know my true identity.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.300
Why?

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:59.020
Because you will die here.

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:00.800
Do you understand?

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.680
Don't waste your time fighting.

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:04.720
Ah!

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:22.400
I'm sorry. I was saved.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.610
Are you okay?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.490
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:30.750
He's so weak!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:33.620
Don't you want to talk to him, Chan?

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:37.380
Idiot! If he's a weak fighter, there's no point in talking to him!

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.020
It's a mistake to think that such a weak guy is a Gundam fighter!

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.670
That's true.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.550
Then Chan might be able to get on the Gundam better.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.960
That's a good idea!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.860
If he does well, he might be able to get on the Gundam!

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:59.020
Hey, let me hear you!

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:00.300
How about you?

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:00.860
Yeah.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:12.480
That was a tough one, wasn't it?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:13.260
Yeah.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.700
I didn't think I'd be attacked in the middle of the city.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:19.320
We're ready.

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:21.030
What the hell are you doing?

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:24.400
I'm going to check if the guy I attacked today is a Gundam Fighter.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:26.820
Here it is!

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.400
Neo-Indian Cobra Gundam.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.180
This is how you attack in the first round.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:35.770
What a trick.

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:36.820
Fighter.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.000
Wait a minute.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:40.220
I knew it.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:42.180
Neo-Indian Shijima.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.580
It seems that this guy is the next opponent.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:49.030
Why did he get the battle information first?

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:50.940
Don't worry about it.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.570
Just knowing that he was a strong opponent gave him a chance.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:56.650
Then, I'm at God Gundam's place.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.650
If you have any food, call me.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:07:59.680
What's that?

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.860
But I don't have enough hands to go play.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.200
Someone help me!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.570
Wayne, this is a good opportunity.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:07.810
Tell Min to cook.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.050
Eh? What?

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:13.310
Does that mean my cooking is bad?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:30.620
Not yet.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:34.310
Hey, is this really the God Gundam's doorknob?

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.400
Y-Yeah...

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.530
If you lie, I won't forgive you.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.450
Um...

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.410
I really don't want to.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:44.090
Deceiving a friend...

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.990
What are you talking about?

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:47.300
But we're friends.

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:48.800
Hey, hey!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.360
You're saying you're not friends with us?

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.870
You don't have to be friends with us.

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:58.210
I don't want to, but...

00:08:58.620 --> 00:08:58.900
Then!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.700
Do as I say!

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.280
Got it?

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:04.440
Yeah...

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:29.960
Shijima's movements...

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.570
I guess I have no choice but to match it with the God Gundam.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.110
Alright, let's go!

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:50.340
What's wrong? Is something wrong?

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:55.470
It's not just a big deal.

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:56.940
What happened?

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.650
Speak properly.

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:00.820
What the hell just happened?

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:44.890
To think that a child would get on a Gundam!

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.740
Alright, now the Gundam is mine!

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.870
Get off! Hurry and turn off the switch!

00:10:52.510 --> 00:10:52.910
No!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.380
This is mine!

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:37.560
Did you think that you could get on the God Gundam if you fooled me?!

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:38.580
I won.

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.660
I fell.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.040
If you move in a bad way, your body will be torn apart!

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.410
That's not true!

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:05.840
Take your clothes off!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:28.330
Tomorrow's match is going to be fun.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:30.380
Concussion!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:32.930
Seema!?

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:34.450
Why are you here!?

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:38.340
In the dark!

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:55.530
Answer me!

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.340
Did he ask you to do this!?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.700
Did Shijima ask you to do this?!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:02.940
U-Um...

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:03.940
That's...

00:13:04.960 --> 00:13:07.490
I...

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.980
That's enough.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.050
I understand.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:16.360
U-Um...

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:17.630
I...

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:26.720
That person...

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:27.880
Could it be that he got injured?

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:28.680
Yeah.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.240
When I was trying to save you...

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:31.660
What?

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:38.240
I got injured because of me.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.470
That guy...

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.030
He had a fight tomorrow, didn't he?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.770
Today's first match.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:46.780
Neo-France's Gundam Rose

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:51.270
has won the second place at the Neo-Orange.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:53.430
The second match will continue

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:54.910
here at the Victoria Peak Ring.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.330
I'll be back then.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.000
What's wrong? You're not feeling well?

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:10.730
Oh, aren't you going to cheer me on?

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:17.340
No way, I'm not going to lose because I'm injured, am I?

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:22.640
Well, Toho-sensei, Shijima reported that he was injured.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:28.660
Oh, but that will also be a good trial for Domon.

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:29.980
Trial?

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.700
It's a matter of time before it's too late.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:36.220
Shall we begin, Shijima?

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:41.650
How's your injury?

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:44.350
Domon Kashuu!

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:44.850
What?

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:55.720
A Gundam from inside?

00:14:58.900 --> 00:14:59.920
Domon Kashuu!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.720
Looks like I'm the one who's going to put the dust on your declaration of victory!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.440
Hmph! You'll have to tell me after you've won!

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:12.160
The Cobra Gums are also ready to fight!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.780
Who will win?

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:18.010
Alright! Let's do a Gundam fight!

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:41.260
I'm going to take advantage of your weakness!

00:16:08.960 --> 00:16:12.290
I don't think this is the end.

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:16.130
I don't think you can get out of here.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:26.030
What are you doing? I'm going to open it!

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:29.540
Hire me! Appear! Master me!

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:33.200
Shut up! Even if you don't tell me, I know it's you!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.090
How are you? Are you feeling unwell?

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.730
Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:45.180
It's all my fault...

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:10.980
We're in the middle of a fight right now!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:26.980
Hey! We can talk later!

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:36.290
It's me, Chan, who got on the Gundam by myself!

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:38.820
I did it all on my own!

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.180
Shijima and Gulu didn't do it, did they?

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:43.080
That's not true!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.540
I wanted to get on the Gundam just once!

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:54.820
I won't do it again, so please don't lose!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:00.700
I got it!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:04.690
I just have to win, right?

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:10.950
I'll finish you off soon!

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:21.350
This guy!

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.700
What did you do?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.640
This is the end.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.760
Hota!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.060
At that time...

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:34.370
Don't move!

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.820
If you don't move, your body will be torn apart!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:40.540
I have my own way!

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.580
Uwaaah!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:45.980
You're doing a terrible thing.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:47.990
Toma!

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:59.870
Thanks to you...

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:00.570
It seems that there is a gap in the escape!

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:07.970
My hands are burning!

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.510
Grab the distance!

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:12.670
Scream!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:15.740
Let's go!

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:20.160
Explosion!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:21.260
Bigger!

00:19:32.460 --> 00:19:45.800
I won the second round.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.480
He seems to be happy with his victory.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.280
Of course.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:52.710
Manadeshi is coming.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.840
To fight me.

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:04.680
You can sing for me like you do for me

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:20.420
We're friends, aren't we?

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:24.160
Um, are you okay?

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:29.640
My body isn't that weak. You too.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.340
Train your body while you can.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.770
If you do that, you might be able to ride the Gundam this time.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:40.140
All right. That's a good answer.

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.720
You're my friend.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:29.800
Well, everyone, there are terrible fighters in this world.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:37.220
The reason is that those who have decided to fight him have all died suddenly.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:41.080
His name is Kiraru Shinigami.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.920
Wonderful. It's not an accident.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:50.450
Now it's your turn, Domon Kashuu!

00:21:50.650 --> 00:21:59.160
Domon, who has declared his victory, is safe with this mysterious fighter, Mandara Gundam.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.560
Will they be able to fight?

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:03.440
Well then,

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:05.100
Gundam Fight!

00:22:05.680 --> 00:22:06.520
Ready...

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:07.220
Go!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:11.120
Domon is targeted!

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:13.580
The Korshia Fighter's Impact Sword!

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:18.460
The Gundam Fight Final League!

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:19.730
Here at the stadium,

00:22:20.410 --> 00:22:22.900
Neo Norway's Viking Gundam and

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:25.230
Neo Germany's Gundam Spiegel

00:22:25.230 --> 00:22:27.210
have finally come to an end!

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:32.240
The Vikings are good!

00:22:36.060 --> 00:22:45.730
Well, let's do it soon!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.520
Let's do it!

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:04.970
I did it!

00:23:05.550 --> 00:23:12.420
Huh? What?

00:23:12.860 --> 00:23:15.240
You're too naive. I'm right here!

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:20.020
Uwaaah!

00:23:20.140 --> 00:23:26.730
You're too naive. I'm right here!

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:42.620
And the rescue team is heading for the Viking Gundam, but it's a great fighter to save the enemy, and it's wonderful to be Shibarutsu Blue!

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.330
I ended up doing it before I knew it.

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:52.320
Really? It's like a trick.

00:23:52.780 --> 00:23:57.070
Hey, sis, which is stronger, the Gundam over there or my brother's Gundam?

00:23:58.470 --> 00:23:59.580
It's obvious!

00:24:04.090 --> 00:24:05.400
Haha, that's true.

00:24:05.780 --> 00:24:06.260
Maybe.

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:09.230
You can't do that!

00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:09.900
Absolutely!

00:24:10.620 --> 00:24:10.780
Absolutely?

00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:21.750
It's a coincidence to meet you at such a place!

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:24.380
Hehe, how was your meal?

00:24:24.760 --> 00:24:27.840
No, um, I'll hold back in Chibo.

00:24:31.440 --> 00:24:34.530
It's Domo-nii-chan's fault!

00:24:34.710 --> 00:24:36.200
If you touch it, I won't forgive you!

00:24:36.760 --> 00:24:38.340
Gah! It's Domo-nii-chan's fault?

00:24:38.620 --> 00:24:39.990
Wait, Domo...

00:24:39.990 --> 00:24:41.280
Chibode, the scout.

00:24:41.640 --> 00:24:43.820
Domo! When did you start going to the nursery?

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:45.680
Hurry up and go!

00:24:45.860 --> 00:24:46.680
Don't get in my way!

00:24:47.160 --> 00:24:50.830
You see, Rain and Domo are just friends.

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:53.660
So there's no problem if I mess with Rain.

00:24:54.780 --> 00:24:55.360
Got it?

00:24:55.940 --> 00:24:59.480
Is that so?

00:25:02.560 --> 00:25:10.670
By the way, Domon, I heard you're being targeted by the Death God.

00:25:11.890 --> 00:25:12.900
The Death God?

00:25:13.140 --> 00:25:16.020
Don't you know? He'll be your next opponent.

00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:22.050
The Neo-Nepal Gundam Fighter, Kirarumekirel Matamata Fusensho.

00:25:23.040 --> 00:25:23.960
Could it be an assassination?

00:25:25.180 --> 00:25:27.820
Shouldn't you be more careful in the dark?

00:25:27.820 --> 00:25:28.500
Isn't that better?

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:33.220
Thank you for the advice, Chibo, but it seems you were a little late.

00:25:33.760 --> 00:25:34.200
What?

00:25:34.820 --> 00:25:39.920
I'm Monkash.

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:42.440
What do you want?

00:25:42.640 --> 00:25:45.260
I want you to die.

00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:51.770
In this city!

00:25:52.170 --> 00:25:54.200
I won't choose a place!

00:25:56.180 --> 00:25:58.940
I'll kill you!

00:26:01.600 --> 00:26:03.120
Damn it! He's aiming at me from right in front of me!

00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:06.580
Leave it to me! I'll wait here!

00:26:06.820 --> 00:26:11.570
You've come a long way.

00:26:20.980 --> 00:26:23.000
Don't think you can escape from me.

00:26:23.940 --> 00:26:24.340
What?

00:26:30.960 --> 00:26:33.260
If it gets this dark, we'll have to get out of there too.

00:26:33.540 --> 00:26:35.030
I-Is that so?

00:26:35.610 --> 00:26:39.780
Darkness has no meaning to me!

00:26:40.160 --> 00:26:41.480
G-Glary!

00:26:41.560 --> 00:26:42.600
Gyaa!

00:26:42.760 --> 00:26:42.980
Ni!

00:26:57.300 --> 00:26:58.710
Fufufufu...

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:02.900
Ha ha ha, I'll make it easy for you with a single blow.

00:27:03.140 --> 00:27:05.530
You couldn't see?

00:27:06.230 --> 00:27:07.780
What's wrong with that?

00:27:07.900 --> 00:27:11.960
King Shaku...

00:27:11.960 --> 00:27:15.640
But if you get into his heart, it won't be of any use.

00:27:16.000 --> 00:27:18.380
Let's go!

00:27:30.410 --> 00:27:30.830
Is that so?

00:27:31.190 --> 00:27:49.180
Is there no other way?

00:28:17.180 --> 00:28:18.500
I'll leave my life to you.

00:28:32.110 --> 00:28:33.260
What? You've seen it?

00:28:33.660 --> 00:28:35.220
What do you mean?

00:28:35.500 --> 00:28:37.940
The fight against Neo Japan is two days away!

00:28:39.420 --> 00:28:42.680
The world of the killer is divided into two parts, whether you live or die.

00:28:43.740 --> 00:28:47.170
It depends on luck and skill.

00:28:47.550 --> 00:28:49.140
Things like this happen.

00:28:49.920 --> 00:28:51.300
What are you talking about?

00:28:51.520 --> 00:28:52.000
Listen!

00:28:52.650 --> 00:28:56.090
You lost your light and were kicked out of the Gundam Fight once.

00:28:57.140 --> 00:28:58.780
Why is the government hiring you?

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:03.270
I'm sure you're looking at your skills as a murderer!

00:29:06.220 --> 00:29:10.090
I'm a professional killer.

00:29:10.410 --> 00:29:11.070
I always defeat the target.

00:29:12.550 --> 00:29:14.420
I don't need any more words.

00:29:15.540 --> 00:29:28.600
I will definitely kill Domon Kash.

00:29:32.340 --> 00:29:40.970
Hiraru was originally an excellent fighter.

00:29:41.350 --> 00:29:43.640
It's about the 11th tournament.

00:29:44.300 --> 00:29:47.760
It seems that he was a strong man who was even said to be the candidate for the championship.

00:29:48.760 --> 00:29:50.680
This arm is sharp.

00:29:51.170 --> 00:29:53.910
He continued to crush the enemy in the waves with his power.

00:30:06.780 --> 00:30:14.920
When the final was almost over, he was a little careless.

00:30:15.810 --> 00:30:17.130
I-I can't take it anymore!

00:30:17.730 --> 00:30:23.230
That was his last light in this world.

00:30:23.390 --> 00:30:29.800
If that's the case...

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:34.860
Even if I die, I'll pay for it as soon as possible.

00:30:35.000 --> 00:30:41.510
But why did he come back to the fight again?

00:30:42.990 --> 00:30:49.260
He probably hated the Gundam fight where he took the light from himself and revived as a god of death.

00:30:49.900 --> 00:30:50.840
For revenge.

00:31:01.080 --> 00:31:28.820
My speed is at my best!

00:31:30.410 --> 00:31:35.010
To break this, we have to jump into the place!

00:31:38.120 --> 00:31:44.920
It's impossible, isn't it?

00:31:44.960 --> 00:31:50.570
That's right. The reach is too short compared to the attack range of the day.

00:31:50.570 --> 00:31:55.270
Even so, if we dive into the place, Kiraru's shikomi katana is waiting.

00:32:08.670 --> 00:32:08.910
Hiraru!

00:32:09.010 --> 00:32:10.720
What the hell are you doing?

00:32:11.040 --> 00:32:11.580
Stop!

00:32:13.130 --> 00:32:15.070
Look at his feet!

00:32:17.660 --> 00:32:21.390
He keeps standing with his whole body concentrated on the float on the surface of the water.

00:32:21.390 --> 00:32:23.050
It's a tremendous concentration.

00:32:23.490 --> 00:32:27.120
And in such a place, it's better to give up.

00:32:28.480 --> 00:32:29.680
I understand.

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:32.610
If that's the case, then prepare yourself!

00:32:33.230 --> 00:32:39.580
I will send all those weaklings like you to that world!

00:32:40.840 --> 00:32:45.700
On the battlefield, the only one you can rely on is yourself!

00:32:47.460 --> 00:32:48.460
You bastard!

00:32:49.080 --> 00:32:49.320
Chibate!

00:32:50.560 --> 00:32:57.140
What did you say!?

00:32:58.320 --> 00:32:59.870
Listen, I am...

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:04.000
I will never forget the Gundam flight that stole the light from my eyes!

00:33:04.476 --> 00:33:08.956
That's right! I'll show you the darkness of this world!

00:33:25.212 --> 00:33:25.912
This is bad.

00:33:26.620 --> 00:33:28.800
There is no way for him to win at this rate.

00:33:29.276 --> 00:33:29.996
What should I do?

00:33:30.000 --> 00:33:34.680
Hmph! Your head is nothing but a waste of time!

00:33:35.910 --> 00:33:37.920
Schwarz!

00:33:38.300 --> 00:33:43.820
Domon, aren't you just afraid of Kiraru's skill that you just got once?

00:33:45.260 --> 00:33:46.670
That's not true!

00:33:47.370 --> 00:33:49.920
Then, what about that Meikyo Shisui's mind?

00:33:51.760 --> 00:33:57.300
I'll make you remember!

00:33:57.460 --> 00:33:58.240
Domon!

00:34:09.020 --> 00:34:09.780
Farewell, my friends!

00:34:30.250 --> 00:34:36.680
What kind of battle will the Mandara Gundam show us?

00:34:38.080 --> 00:34:51.810
If I give it up, Kiraru will die.

00:34:52.410 --> 00:34:54.220
Don't worry.

00:35:03.290 --> 00:35:06.010
Here, I declare the battle between God Gundam and Mandara Gundam!

00:35:07.710 --> 00:35:08.990
Gundam Fight!

00:35:09.370 --> 00:35:10.240
Eri!

00:35:10.340 --> 00:35:23.680
Mandara Gundam!

00:35:23.680 --> 00:35:23.820
No!

00:35:31.400 --> 00:35:32.000
No, I can't!

00:35:32.120 --> 00:35:35.740
If I jump into his heart, I'll be waiting for the bell to ring!

00:35:35.980 --> 00:35:36.880
I can't use Godfinger!

00:35:37.620 --> 00:35:38.660
No way!

00:35:40.380 --> 00:35:41.940
Oh, God Gundam!

00:35:41.940 --> 00:35:42.560
To the Barrier!

00:35:44.480 --> 00:35:45.860
What's wrong?

00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:46.520
Can't you do anything?

00:35:47.700 --> 00:35:49.220
Then how about this?

00:35:49.560 --> 00:35:50.820
Gengoku Ripper!

00:35:51.340 --> 00:35:56.120
It's an amazing flame!

00:35:56.760 --> 00:35:57.460
Mandara Ganga!

00:35:59.050 --> 00:35:59.390
Sumikomi!

00:36:10.300 --> 00:36:13.500
And that cheeky samurai boy is also The End, isn't he?

00:36:13.810 --> 00:36:14.410
I wonder.

00:36:14.790 --> 00:36:18.780
If you ask me, that Kiraru has failed to assassinate Domon once.

00:36:19.140 --> 00:36:24.130
But with the flow of Toho's corruption, that's a life-saving.

00:36:24.810 --> 00:36:26.050
Then let's look forward to it.

00:36:26.370 --> 00:36:28.590
The reverse homerun behind the 9th floor.

00:36:31.630 --> 00:36:36.850
Do you want to burn to death? Or do you want to jump into the depths of me, the God of Death, and drop your head?

00:36:38.010 --> 00:36:42.120
Remember! A faith that's too influential!

00:36:43.440 --> 00:36:48.090
That's right! What do you do when you're afraid of death? What do you do when you're afraid of the enemy?

00:36:48.900 --> 00:36:52.490
I'm the King of Hearts! The strongest!

00:37:00.960 --> 00:37:03.080
My hands are burning red!

00:37:03.300 --> 00:37:06.510
I'll grab victory and scream out loud!

00:37:07.230 --> 00:37:08.310
Explosion!

00:37:08.710 --> 00:37:09.420
It's no good!

00:37:09.760 --> 00:37:10.340
Let's cut it!

00:37:11.280 --> 00:37:11.800
Go!

00:37:13.430 --> 00:37:14.290
Pick up!

00:37:14.690 --> 00:37:18.080
The surface is...

00:37:38.350 --> 00:37:44.260
The Gundam fight is different from just killing each other even if you risk your life.

00:37:44.260 --> 00:37:47.310
Will you win or lose in this ring?

00:37:47.390 --> 00:37:49.290
Forget about that.

00:37:49.390 --> 00:37:51.820
Before the fight, you showed me your true colors.

00:37:52.520 --> 00:37:56.910
The same hand will never be used on the King of Hearts!

00:38:00.990 --> 00:38:02.410
How much more do you want me to be ashamed of you?

00:38:04.280 --> 00:38:07.980
KUNUTSU GOD SLASH!

00:38:08.600 --> 00:38:11.840
I see...

00:38:11.840 --> 00:38:13.880
So you're saying you're going to settle this?

00:38:15.860 --> 00:38:17.040
Then I'll take your place!

00:38:17.180 --> 00:38:17.580
Yeah!

00:38:18.210 --> 00:38:25.910
I don't feel like it.

00:38:26.010 --> 00:38:27.240
Don't do it.

00:38:27.500 --> 00:38:29.140
The match will be decided in an instant.

00:38:45.550 --> 00:38:47.170
I'm going to tell you now!

00:38:47.290 --> 00:38:49.810
The grudge from my GUNZAM HEIGHT!

00:38:52.640 --> 00:38:53.940
My grudge!

00:38:54.180 --> 00:38:57.200
I'm going to kill you!

00:39:30.890 --> 00:39:35.840
It was a pleasure to be able to fight a man like you with a sword again.

00:39:38.050 --> 00:39:42.340
You're useless!

00:39:53.710 --> 00:39:59.080
But in order to hide the murder of Hyrule...

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.140
I'll let you go.

00:40:01.200 --> 00:40:02.420
Oh, as it is!

00:40:03.380 --> 00:40:08.470
It's a matter of course to destroy evidence, but I'll let you stop doing unnecessary things.

00:40:08.850 --> 00:40:12.820
If you don't, I'll have Kiran take all the fights and assassinations you've ever had!

00:40:14.680 --> 00:40:16.950
Take it.

00:40:17.410 --> 00:40:18.320
All right.

00:40:18.980 --> 00:40:20.580
Domon! It was a nice fight!

00:40:21.160 --> 00:40:28.500
I see. You're quite a fun guy, Domon Kashi.

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:32.000
I'm looking forward to today's match.

00:40:33.516 --> 00:40:38.156
Hehehe, Domon, I'll be waiting for you anytime.

00:40:55.756 --> 00:40:56.256
Cush!

00:40:57.036 --> 00:40:58.676
I won't forget.

00:41:00.250 --> 00:41:03.750
The appearance of those who supported you in that last moment.

00:41:04.270 --> 00:41:09.390
I can't believe I can see such a wonderful thing in your eyes again.

00:41:14.350 --> 00:41:14.850
Farewell!

00:41:19.220 --> 00:41:20.950
Where are you going, Kiraru?

00:41:21.130 --> 00:41:24.840
I'm going to wash my feet from the fight and walk with the people I've killed.

00:41:27.140 --> 00:41:29.530
The sin you have committed...

00:41:30.190 --> 00:41:35.180
He knows best that it's not something he can at least atone for.

00:41:36.830 --> 00:41:38.640
Saizen! Kiraru!

00:41:38.920 --> 00:41:56.940
Now everyone, this Gundam Fight Final League match has finally come to an end, and each of them has become desperate to crush the opponent.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:05.870
And today's main event is the Dragon Gundam vs. Neo-Denmark's Mermaid Gundam.

00:42:06.860 --> 00:42:12.640
But in the midst of the battle, Saicai will be made to dance on the red thread that the goddess of fate is weaving.

00:42:16.660 --> 00:42:18.650
As if she had met the real doll.

00:42:21.040 --> 00:42:23.320
Well then, Gundam fight!

00:42:24.240 --> 00:42:25.360
Ready, go!

00:42:26.020 --> 00:42:29.450
Yaihouki!

00:42:30.320 --> 00:42:32.240
Love is throbbing, Saisei-shi!

00:42:32.280 --> 00:42:41.940
This is Neo-Denmark's Mermaid Gundam.

00:42:41.980 --> 00:42:44.510
Our next opponent is...

00:42:44.510 --> 00:42:47.720
Don't underestimate us, Saisei-shi!

00:42:47.800 --> 00:42:50.860
If you win, the Shorinji will not be restored!

00:42:51.260 --> 00:42:51.890
I know!

00:42:52.610 --> 00:42:54.510
Oh, old men! You're here!

00:42:54.910 --> 00:42:55.010
Huh?

00:42:55.710 --> 00:42:56.870
Oh, Mr. Rain!

00:42:57.370 --> 00:42:59.820
Oh, it's my sister! And...

00:43:01.340 --> 00:43:01.800
What are you talking about?

00:43:02.080 --> 00:43:04.960
This is just a test between you two.

00:43:05.580 --> 00:43:07.130
I don't think I need this.

00:43:07.810 --> 00:43:08.770
What are you talking about?

00:43:09.090 --> 00:43:11.660
I'm also your strategist.

00:43:12.900 --> 00:43:14.630
Well, well, you two.

00:43:14.990 --> 00:43:16.180
The game is over.

00:43:17.300 --> 00:43:17.820
Look.

00:43:18.340 --> 00:43:19.900
Matador's final move.

00:43:20.060 --> 00:43:21.300
Red Flag Camon.

00:43:21.640 --> 00:43:23.040
It's amazing no matter how many times I look at it.

00:43:23.970 --> 00:43:25.350
How is it, Mermaid?

00:43:26.870 --> 00:43:27.390
M-

00:43:34.350 --> 00:43:34.750
It's the other way around!

00:44:04.890 --> 00:44:08.090
As expected, he only made it to the final tournament. He's making good moves.

00:44:09.270 --> 00:44:11.040
No, I can't say that's the case.

00:44:11.840 --> 00:44:16.160
He's been covering well and fighting well, but that machine is already at its limit.

00:44:16.500 --> 00:44:19.000
After that, the first match will be the last.

00:44:19.300 --> 00:44:22.380
Then, in a match with the Dragon Gundam...

00:44:22.380 --> 00:44:24.660
Literally, he's going to turn his eyes and stand up.

00:44:25.260 --> 00:44:29.080
Just a little more.

00:44:30.030 --> 00:44:30.790
Please answer me.

00:44:31.030 --> 00:44:34.670
Saishai-shi!

00:44:34.730 --> 00:44:35.910
I will make my dream come true!

00:44:36.270 --> 00:44:36.570
Oh?

00:44:36.930 --> 00:44:38.370
Saishai-shi!

00:44:38.610 --> 00:44:42.990
I don't know if it's a maid Gundam or something, but...

00:44:43.570 --> 00:44:44.710
Do you think I'm going to lose?

00:44:45.810 --> 00:44:47.400
It looks delicious!

00:44:47.800 --> 00:44:48.440
Give me a piece!

00:44:48.960 --> 00:44:51.240
What is this food?

00:44:51.480 --> 00:44:55.040
You're going to make us eat something like this, huh?

00:44:55.500 --> 00:44:57.920
What are you going to do, old man?

00:45:00.640 --> 00:45:03.840
Wow, you're really good at using those classic hands.

00:45:04.720 --> 00:45:05.910
Don't worry about what you're going to say.

00:45:06.230 --> 00:45:09.010
I was watching you guys take out the insects from your pockets.

00:45:09.950 --> 00:45:12.010
Huh? What did you say?

00:45:12.270 --> 00:45:14.930
You have a cute face, and you're having a good time.

00:45:15.850 --> 00:45:17.970
You're not funny at all.

00:45:19.350 --> 00:45:20.030
Say it again!

00:45:20.810 --> 00:45:21.890
Over there!

00:45:23.280 --> 00:45:23.840
Who are you?

00:45:24.200 --> 00:45:25.480
Hmph.

00:45:25.480 --> 00:45:27.160
A handsome boy who's been following the path of justice.

00:45:30.600 --> 00:45:31.220
Let's just leave it at that!

00:45:32.970 --> 00:45:34.490
You've got to be kidding me!

00:46:01.210 --> 00:46:03.700
B-But, we don't lose to anyone except our year-end club!

00:46:05.840 --> 00:46:07.330
That's right!

00:46:08.070 --> 00:46:12.050
That girl is...

00:46:12.050 --> 00:46:13.700
Uncle, are you okay?

00:46:14.000 --> 00:46:15.420
Thank you.

00:46:15.780 --> 00:46:18.260
If it's a thank you, give it to that person, okay?

00:46:18.790 --> 00:46:19.820
Oh, no!

00:46:21.550 --> 00:46:22.030
Uncle!

00:46:22.470 --> 00:46:24.100
The number of cases...

00:46:24.100 --> 00:46:26.150
The business is...

00:46:55.600 --> 00:46:56.440
What are you up to these days?

00:46:57.900 --> 00:46:58.820
Well, that's about it.

00:47:00.160 --> 00:47:00.580
I guess you didn't hear my name.

00:47:03.020 --> 00:47:10.510
I'm not Saesai, I'm Chin Chikurin.

00:47:10.550 --> 00:47:14.090
Chikurin? That's a strange name.

00:47:14.650 --> 00:47:16.710
The Invincible is calling me.

00:47:32.010 --> 00:47:32.230
Good night.

00:47:32.450 --> 00:47:35.740
Good...night.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:07.630
You're late.

00:48:22.680 --> 00:48:27.610
Then let's get to know each other today.

00:48:28.600 --> 00:48:29.610
Are you a man?

00:48:32.900 --> 00:48:33.940
What kind of guy is he?

00:48:34.340 --> 00:48:34.960
Tell me!

00:48:35.080 --> 00:48:35.720
I don't know!

00:49:01.370 --> 00:49:08.180
I've been practicing for 2-3 days, but I'm going to have a cheering band from Shorinji.

00:49:09.400 --> 00:49:14.560
I'm going to have a cheering band from Shorinji.

00:49:14.560 --> 00:49:19.600
I'm going to have a cheering band from Shorinji.

00:49:19.600 --> 00:49:20.970
What's wrong with the whole team?

00:49:20.970 --> 00:49:22.050
What the hell is wrong with them?

00:49:55.120 --> 00:49:57.160
I have a job here, so I came with you.

00:49:57.600 --> 00:49:59.970
Your parents are dead, too.

00:50:00.120 --> 00:50:05.820
Me too. My parents died, too.

00:50:05.820 --> 00:50:08.500
That's why I'm with the old man who raised me as a parent.

00:50:09.700 --> 00:50:11.160
Old man?

00:50:11.440 --> 00:50:14.660
He's not the real old man, though.

00:50:14.920 --> 00:50:17.480
I don't want to be a child anymore.

00:50:18.280 --> 00:50:22.360
But it's nice to have someone who worries about you by your side.

00:50:22.760 --> 00:50:26.060
I don't have any friends here, do I?

00:50:26.240 --> 00:50:28.140
That's why sometimes I feel sad.

00:50:30.640 --> 00:50:31.160
We're here.

00:50:31.380 --> 00:50:36.290
If you don't mind, I'd like to see Shiro.

00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:37.740
Well...

00:50:37.740 --> 00:50:40.020
Thank you.

00:50:40.360 --> 00:50:46.820
Look at that!

00:50:47.120 --> 00:50:47.520
Ouch!

00:50:49.450 --> 00:50:51.250
Even just a greeting...

00:50:51.250 --> 00:50:51.450
Hey!

00:50:51.970 --> 00:50:53.280
At a time like this, you have to be careful.

00:50:54.080 --> 00:50:55.270
Is that so?

00:51:07.680 --> 00:51:10.990
Hey, Tashika, even though this area is a map...

00:51:10.990 --> 00:51:12.900
Ah, there she is.

00:51:12.980 --> 00:51:18.160
Cecil! Cecil! Cecil!

00:51:18.300 --> 00:51:20.430
Hey, hey, next is Cecil-chan!

00:51:21.270 --> 00:51:25.640
You're Tashika...

00:51:25.640 --> 00:51:28.140
You're Neo Denmark's...

00:51:28.140 --> 00:51:29.800
Dragon Gundam's...

00:51:29.800 --> 00:51:29.940
Thank you for watching!

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:32.150
Aita, what are you doing in a place like this?

00:51:32.370 --> 00:51:53.770
I thought you weren't here?

00:51:55.170 --> 00:51:57.220
Yes, I thought you were already here.

00:52:00.540 --> 00:52:01.860
Gong is the best of the best.

00:52:01.980 --> 00:52:04.920
If he doesn't make it in time, he'll lose the match and become a senpai.

00:52:06.180 --> 00:52:07.270
No, no!

00:52:07.370 --> 00:52:10.300
The cheerleaders from Shorinji are here!

00:52:11.060 --> 00:52:13.080
What's wrong with him?

00:52:13.420 --> 00:52:15.750
Is that him?

00:52:16.410 --> 00:52:21.020
He's your friend, right?

00:52:21.160 --> 00:52:22.440
I want to ask you something.

00:52:23.060 --> 00:52:23.460
Huh?

00:52:23.700 --> 00:52:26.620
Listen, Cecil.

00:52:26.740 --> 00:52:28.690
He's the reigning member of Neo China.

00:52:30.320 --> 00:52:31.380
She's my opponent for tomorrow's match.

00:52:31.920 --> 00:52:56.410
What happened?

00:52:56.790 --> 00:52:59.870
If you think about it, she's...

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.670
It's been a long time since I lost to White, and I almost forgot about it.

00:53:04.510 --> 00:53:05.150
But...

00:53:05.460 --> 00:53:07.060
I'll look for it.

00:53:08.000 --> 00:53:12.740
I don't think I can just leave it like this.

00:53:14.150 --> 00:53:14.790
I...

00:53:24.310 --> 00:53:24.890
It's hot.

00:53:26.590 --> 00:53:28.800
I can't do any work.

00:53:30.800 --> 00:53:34.670
Huh? Those guys?

00:53:35.110 --> 00:53:39.780
The match is coming soon.

00:53:40.060 --> 00:53:42.650
I know. Why are you here?

00:53:43.030 --> 00:53:48.870
Cecil-chan!

00:53:49.050 --> 00:53:50.360
Aren't you going to the fight?

00:53:51.080 --> 00:53:53.360
Did you make up your mind?

00:53:53.640 --> 00:53:55.460
If we fight, we'll definitely win.

00:53:55.820 --> 00:53:57.540
I feel sorry for those of us who are going to lose.

00:53:57.860 --> 00:53:59.850
That's not what I mean.

00:54:02.300 --> 00:54:04.200
Mermaid Gundam's mech is already broken.

00:54:04.740 --> 00:54:09.180
So if it breaks, you'll have to go back to the country.

00:54:10.280 --> 00:54:13.610
Then we won't be able to see each other again!

00:54:14.110 --> 00:54:23.310
I know.

00:54:23.630 --> 00:54:27.850
I know Mermaid Gundam can't beat Dragon Gundam.

00:54:30.890 --> 00:54:34.510
But I'm the only one who believes that Onii-chan will definitely win!

00:54:34.950 --> 00:54:36.430
Cecil...

00:54:36.430 --> 00:54:38.440
Yes! Fight!

00:54:39.460 --> 00:54:41.040
Fight with all your might!

00:54:41.080 --> 00:54:52.280
I thought you were that kid from back then!

00:54:53.230 --> 00:54:55.790
Sorry, but I don't have time to play with you guys right now!

00:54:56.110 --> 00:54:57.050
Let's go!

00:54:58.190 --> 00:54:59.290
Yeah, let's go!

00:55:00.000 --> 00:55:04.980
I'll make sure you pay back all your grudges!

00:55:05.100 --> 00:55:05.980
You guys!

00:55:06.460 --> 00:55:06.900
Wait!

00:55:08.550 --> 00:55:12.400
I won this fight!

00:55:13.720 --> 00:55:16.610
Saesashi, hurry up and go to the arena!

00:55:17.090 --> 00:55:18.720
Big bro! Big sis!

00:55:19.720 --> 00:55:20.260
Thank you!

00:55:20.480 --> 00:55:21.720
Let's go!

00:55:22.000 --> 00:55:25.820
Shut up!

00:55:26.760 --> 00:55:27.580
I'll be your opponent!

00:55:28.320 --> 00:55:29.140
I won!

00:55:46.920 --> 00:55:49.490
You're the only one who can do it! Show me your skills!

00:56:01.440 --> 00:56:01.700
I know.

00:56:02.000 --> 00:56:04.900
These guys are just one foot away from being enough!

00:56:05.340 --> 00:56:23.080
Did I make it in time?

00:56:23.920 --> 00:56:26.060
Only two minutes left until the match begins.

00:56:26.060 --> 00:56:29.290
But the opponent, the Dragon Gundam, is still...

00:56:30.350 --> 00:56:30.610
I'm not going to do it.

00:56:30.670 --> 00:56:34.230
At this rate, the negative results of Neo-Denmark will be certain.

00:56:34.710 --> 00:56:37.740
On the other hand, what is the situation of the Neochina Shorinji fan club?

00:56:40.860 --> 00:56:42.500
If you don't mind, please say something.

00:56:42.760 --> 00:56:45.890
At this rate, we will be the best in Shorinji.

00:56:46.790 --> 00:56:48.550
It's a dream of another dream.

00:56:49.220 --> 00:56:52.260
Everyone's death, Yo-Yo-Yo-Yo-Yo!

00:56:55.260 --> 00:56:57.210
Forgive me.

00:56:57.370 --> 00:56:59.420
This is also our fault.

00:57:00.000 --> 00:57:03.090
In this match, there will be no opponent

00:57:04.370 --> 00:57:05.250
Shut up!

00:57:05.510 --> 00:57:08.400
Idiot!

00:57:08.400 --> 00:57:10.030
I'm coming!

00:57:10.570 --> 00:57:11.910
I'm coming!

00:57:12.150 --> 00:57:26.940
I was surprised that you were my sister's boyfriend

00:57:26.940 --> 00:57:29.680
It was me!

00:57:30.700 --> 00:57:31.980
I never thought you were Cecil's older brother!

00:57:33.480 --> 00:57:36.540
I'm your sister's friend, so I won't hold back!

00:57:37.350 --> 00:57:38.050
Me too!

00:57:38.570 --> 00:57:42.270
If you insist, let's do a Gundam fight!

00:57:42.630 --> 00:57:52.380
That's the other way around!

00:57:52.640 --> 00:57:55.540
In this battle, I'll get rid of all of Mermaid Gundam!

00:58:25.980 --> 00:58:27.000
Damn it!

00:58:56.970 --> 00:58:57.390
Don't do it!

00:59:00.860 --> 00:59:01.380
Onii-chan!

00:59:01.540 --> 00:59:10.220
The true power of the Amade Gundam!

00:59:10.660 --> 00:59:12.230
Damn it!

00:59:12.510 --> 00:59:14.140
It's over!

00:59:14.660 --> 00:59:14.920
Ran!

01:00:00.120 --> 01:00:02.860
I did it, Cecil! I defeated the Dragon Gundam!

01:00:04.080 --> 01:00:08.150
I got my revenge!

01:00:09.110 --> 01:00:15.740
Idiot! Idiot!

01:00:16.130 --> 01:00:23.210
I'm so proud of you, Treasurer!

01:00:32.390 --> 01:00:37.170
You used your own arm to win?

01:00:37.350 --> 01:00:39.460
You were really strong.

01:00:40.230 --> 01:00:41.370
I lost.

01:01:04.000 --> 01:01:05.590
Sai-Sai-Shi, you did a good job.

01:01:05.750 --> 01:01:07.420
Big brother...

01:01:07.420 --> 01:01:08.570
It was a good fight.

01:01:09.090 --> 01:01:23.780
I knew you'd say that.

01:01:24.570 --> 01:01:26.210
I can't help it if the Mermaid Gundam is gone.

01:01:28.400 --> 01:01:29.870
I'm sorry.

01:01:30.670 --> 01:01:33.020
I'm glad you fought with all your heart.

01:01:33.680 --> 01:01:36.390
Cecil, it's about time.

01:01:36.790 --> 01:01:40.520
Thank you for everything.

01:01:40.580 --> 01:01:43.500
I'll never forget you.

01:02:00.730 --> 01:02:01.790
I'm fine!

01:02:12.630 --> 01:02:14.430
I'm innocent and innocent.

01:02:14.950 --> 01:02:16.830
No one can be a child.

01:02:18.730 --> 01:02:23.340
It may be an apology to treat us as children forever.

01:02:30.760 --> 01:02:34.880
Cecil, I promise! I will win for sure!

01:02:34.900 --> 01:02:38.120
Just watch me, Cecil!

01:03:13.310 --> 01:03:16.120
Well, everyone, a surprising craze has occurred.

01:03:16.540 --> 01:03:20.620
That Neo-Russian Argo Galsky has been defeated.

01:03:21.140 --> 01:03:24.780
Moreover, the game time is only 48 seconds.

01:03:24.980 --> 01:03:29.940
The opponent is the completely unknown Neo Sweden's Nobel Gundam until yesterday.

01:03:37.360 --> 01:03:42.310
Well then, today's Gundam fight is going to be a stormy one!

01:03:42.430 --> 01:03:47.700
Well then, Gundam fight, ready, go!

01:03:48.380 --> 01:03:54.080
Girls Fighter Dangerous R&B

01:04:01.150 --> 01:04:01.630
What the hell are you doing, Shido?

01:04:02.230 --> 01:04:03.190
Don't get in my way!

01:04:05.610 --> 01:04:07.590
Get out of my way!

01:04:07.590 --> 01:04:07.790
Get out of my way!

01:04:07.890 --> 01:04:20.440
What the hell is this?

01:04:20.460 --> 01:04:21.660
It's a disaster.

01:04:22.680 --> 01:04:25.700
The defeat of Neo-Russian Vice-Colonel Allenby Beazley.

01:04:27.360 --> 01:04:28.290
Damn it!

01:04:30.284 --> 01:04:33.124
Even if you're not a reporter, I'd like to ask you a reason.

01:04:33.356 --> 01:04:33.856
Thank you!

01:04:34.412 --> 01:04:36.012
How long have you been here?

01:04:36.908 --> 01:04:38.868
I came to see your match.

01:04:39.500 --> 01:04:41.640
It was over by the time I got there.

01:04:42.636 --> 01:04:43.796
What do you mean?

01:04:44.044 --> 01:04:45.744
A man like you...

01:04:46.860 --> 01:04:49.220
That's something I'd like to hear too.

01:04:49.868 --> 01:04:52.388
I can't believe I lost to someone like that!

01:04:53.708 --> 01:04:54.868
The result is everything.

01:04:55.564 --> 01:04:57.264
No matter what I say, it becomes an excuse.

01:04:57.836 --> 01:04:58.336
Bye.

01:04:58.412 --> 01:04:59.412
That's all I can say.

01:05:01.080 --> 01:05:04.120
Allenby is dangerous. He looks like him sometimes.

01:05:04.180 --> 01:05:06.760
Me? What do you mean?

01:05:08.100 --> 01:05:10.560
He doesn't know what will happen in a Gundam fight.

01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:13.410
You can ask him enough questions.

01:05:14.220 --> 01:05:27.320
You mean he encouraged you?

01:05:27.900 --> 01:05:29.820
Yeah, you can ask him too.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:30.300
Be careful.

01:05:30.720 --> 01:05:33.720
Oh my, what kind of friendship is this?

01:05:34.830 --> 01:05:40.280
What are those two trying to show?

01:05:41.250 --> 01:05:53.110
Well, the game hasn't changed a bit.

01:06:00.510 --> 01:06:01.170
Let's go, Nomurae!

01:06:02.450 --> 01:06:04.780
Yeah! It's a super popular experience game!

01:06:05.400 --> 01:06:07.100
Onii-chan, you like this kind of thing, don't you?

01:06:07.560 --> 01:06:17.120
It's like a Gundam fight.

01:06:17.920 --> 01:06:18.220
Really!

01:06:19.230 --> 01:06:20.430
I can't win this.

01:06:20.770 --> 01:06:21.340
Let's go!

01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:52.680
There's no one who has the courage to challenge this invincible champion, no one, no one, no one!

01:06:53.810 --> 01:06:55.730
So, is it over?

01:06:56.070 --> 01:06:57.670
I thought there was someone who was a little more reliable.

01:07:00.410 --> 01:07:01.330
You don't want to be a pro?

01:07:01.530 --> 01:07:02.420
I don't!

01:07:02.520 --> 01:07:03.800
You don't have to!

01:07:03.980 --> 01:07:07.400
He's a Gundam Fighter!

01:07:07.800 --> 01:07:08.770
He's the one who declared his victory!

01:07:09.770 --> 01:07:12.730
I think he's the King of Hearts.

01:07:13.700 --> 01:07:15.460
G-G-Gundam Fighter...

01:07:15.460 --> 01:07:17.660
Let me introduce you to him.

01:07:17.900 --> 01:07:18.920
I'm fine with that.

01:07:19.700 --> 01:07:20.770
He's a pro.

01:07:21.410 --> 01:07:23.370
That doesn't mean he's good at games.

01:07:23.950 --> 01:07:25.080
He's interesting.

01:07:49.230 --> 01:07:49.490
I'm used to it.

01:08:00.250 --> 01:08:00.850
Here I go!

01:08:01.730 --> 01:08:08.080
No way! That was a trick just now!

01:08:08.600 --> 01:08:10.670
So I have to be a little more serious!

01:08:12.030 --> 01:08:12.930
No good!

01:08:17.200 --> 01:08:17.460
Kill!

01:08:34.510 --> 01:08:37.070
She's serious! Who the hell is she?

01:09:00.510 --> 01:09:00.930
We're going to explode!

01:09:46.090 --> 01:09:48.480
It's the first time I've ever fought against you.

01:09:48.480 --> 01:09:50.820
But next time, I'll definitely win!

01:09:51.300 --> 01:09:53.080
Yeah, that's what I want.

01:09:53.500 --> 01:09:58.800
Wait, what's your name?

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:02.000
Allenby! Allenby Beardsley!

01:10:02.970 --> 01:10:03.750
Allenby, huh?

01:10:18.470 --> 01:10:21.040
What? Allenby Beardsley, you say?

01:10:21.280 --> 01:10:27.040
I see...

01:10:27.040 --> 01:10:28.680
The one who broke the Argon...

01:10:49.230 --> 01:10:51.600
The victory of the Neo-Sweden Space Army.

01:10:52.100 --> 01:10:54.230
Conquering the military combat technique,

01:10:55.110 --> 01:10:57.410
the previous record is the best of all the previous battles.

01:11:00.960 --> 01:11:04.240
Moreover, he has cleaned up all the matches in less than a minute.

01:11:05.160 --> 01:11:05.800
What do you think?

01:11:06.140 --> 01:11:10.130
It's a surprise that so many fighters have been buried until now.

01:11:11.520 --> 01:11:12.860
What do you think about that?

01:11:13.830 --> 01:11:16.050
Hahaha, you're still suspicious.

01:11:17.210 --> 01:11:21.540
For an unknown fighter, checking the surroundings is also a sweet thing.

01:11:22.140 --> 01:11:24.340
Then, do you want to say that you won by chance?

01:11:25.740 --> 01:11:29.660
No, if I don't see the future of the fight, I'll talk to you casually.

01:11:31.860 --> 01:11:36.140
I see. Then let's see if you can do it.

01:11:38.180 --> 01:11:40.080
Well, who are you going to hit?

01:11:41.320 --> 01:11:44.990
It's obvious, isn't it, Toho-sensei?

01:11:45.070 --> 01:11:58.000
What do you think of the God Gundam Domon Kashuu?

01:11:58.440 --> 01:11:59.800
I'm looking forward to it.

01:12:00.480 --> 01:12:00.640
That's right.

01:12:05.500 --> 01:12:20.930
It seems that Allenby caused a commotion again.

01:12:21.130 --> 01:12:24.400
I didn't do anything. I was just playing.

01:12:24.940 --> 01:12:26.870
Be careful with your polite behavior.

01:12:27.710 --> 01:12:29.580
For you, which one is the best?

01:12:31.600 --> 01:12:35.160
I don't remember asking you to make me a Gundam fighter.

01:12:36.940 --> 01:12:41.330
You seem to be feeling better today.

01:12:42.410 --> 01:12:44.320
Did something good happen?

01:12:45.000 --> 01:12:47.160
Stop looking into people's minds!

01:12:47.680 --> 01:12:50.320
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to.

01:12:51.040 --> 01:12:52.690
Then please.

01:13:09.790 --> 01:13:11.690
I'm not going to listen to what they say anymore.

01:13:32.910 --> 01:13:33.470
You are!

01:13:34.470 --> 01:13:35.230
Domon Kashuu!

01:13:35.630 --> 01:13:48.680
Good evening, how are you doing?

01:13:49.880 --> 01:13:52.040
I'm not doing this because I don't want to.

01:13:53.040 --> 01:13:57.000
This is the first time I've been in a junkyard.

01:13:57.860 --> 01:13:59.590
If you like it, you can have it for dinner.

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:00.820
What do you think?

01:14:00.820 --> 01:14:02.480
Huh? But...

01:14:02.480 --> 01:14:02.880
Huh?

01:14:09.720 --> 01:14:19.070
I knew it.

01:14:19.330 --> 01:14:21.470
This is the first time I've had such a fun meal.

01:14:22.270 --> 01:14:24.010
It's your first time, right?

01:14:24.410 --> 01:14:29.420
But is it really okay to jump out at this time of night?

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:31.840
I'm bored of them.

01:14:32.340 --> 01:14:34.900
Because they only care about me and the Gundam parts.

01:14:36.340 --> 01:14:37.600
That's not true.

01:14:38.120 --> 01:14:41.990
If they're friends from the same country, winning is their common goal.

01:14:42.270 --> 01:14:43.130
I don't have any friends.

01:14:43.370 --> 01:14:49.200
When I was around their age, I lost my parents.

01:14:49.800 --> 01:14:52.360
After that, I was raised in an army facility.

01:14:53.160 --> 01:14:55.250
Just to become a Gundam fighter.

01:14:56.410 --> 01:14:58.420
You're similar.

01:15:00.600 --> 01:15:03.980
But I want to fight fiercely!

01:15:04.300 --> 01:15:05.310
Because...

01:15:05.310 --> 01:15:10.510
Let's settle this with a Gundam fight!

01:15:11.210 --> 01:15:11.790
Yeah!

01:15:12.220 --> 01:15:13.360
I'd love to!

01:15:31.370 --> 01:15:34.170
Finally, we're going to see the real deal.

01:15:34.970 --> 01:15:38.550
As usual, I've made a plan.

01:15:39.110 --> 01:15:40.440
Don't do unnecessary things!

01:15:41.240 --> 01:15:43.570
I want to do it with the real power of Domon!

01:15:45.000 --> 01:15:45.520
I have to fight!

01:15:46.220 --> 01:15:49.000
I'm ready to guide you.

01:15:50.160 --> 01:15:52.280
It's bad to ruin your mental balance before the fight.

01:15:52.680 --> 01:15:54.320
Let's wait and see.

01:15:54.580 --> 01:15:55.520
I'm going!

01:15:56.320 --> 01:15:57.820
Let's show him!

01:15:58.380 --> 01:15:59.970
You and I will save him!

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:00.480
The ultimate fight!

01:16:01.250 --> 01:16:13.680
Solder Gundam Faschinen!

01:16:17.170 --> 01:16:17.350
Thank you.

01:16:31.660 --> 01:16:33.660
One minute has passed.

01:16:34.828 --> 01:16:37.808
Looks like he's not fully equipped yet.

01:16:38.604 --> 01:16:40.604
The power that defeated me!

01:16:44.620 --> 01:16:45.420
It's a game!

01:16:46.156 --> 01:16:47.056
Those two...

01:16:47.532 --> 01:16:49.532
to test each other's strength.

01:16:49.836 --> 01:16:51.396
They're enjoying the game!

01:16:51.980 --> 01:16:54.980
You're amazing, Allenby! You're faster than before!

01:16:54.980 --> 01:16:57.480
This is the first time I've ever had this much fun!

01:16:57.480 --> 01:16:58.480
Watch!

01:16:58.480 --> 01:16:59.480
Thank you!

01:17:01.560 --> 01:17:04.780
I hated the Gundam fight so much.

01:17:04.840 --> 01:17:05.480
What about Allenby?

01:17:05.840 --> 01:17:07.390
But I can't win with this.

01:17:07.550 --> 01:17:09.050
I'll change the strategy.

01:17:09.410 --> 01:17:11.120
Fire the guided wave immediately.

01:17:11.640 --> 01:17:13.090
Please wait a moment.

01:17:13.330 --> 01:17:14.820
This is an order.

01:17:40.110 --> 01:17:41.030
That's it! That's the power!

01:17:49.120 --> 01:17:55.310
With this subliminal system, her potential combat ability is 120%

01:17:55.880 --> 01:17:59.480
And then, Allenby will be invincible

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:00.980
I'm going to beat you to death!

01:18:03.680 --> 01:18:20.090
This cold fist!

01:18:20.390 --> 01:18:26.420
Is it the same human fist that the soul doesn't belong to?

01:18:43.340 --> 01:18:45.620
What do you think of Allenby's ability?

01:18:46.500 --> 01:18:48.260
That's no good.

01:18:48.820 --> 01:18:50.230
Why not?

01:18:50.350 --> 01:18:52.380
A hundred words aren't enough.

01:18:52.820 --> 01:18:55.310
Listen to that Gundam.

01:18:55.470 --> 01:18:58.480
Allenby...

01:18:58.760 --> 01:18:59.520
No...

01:19:00.000 --> 01:19:00.420
That's enough!

01:19:00.760 --> 01:19:02.650
We beat Neo Japan today!

01:19:03.210 --> 01:19:05.940
That's...

01:19:05.940 --> 01:19:06.220
Huh?

01:19:06.680 --> 01:19:07.100
What?

01:19:07.460 --> 01:19:07.580
